eats Republican Dan Sullivan after winning 50.1% of the vote.</summary><category term="News" /></entry><entry><title>APEC summit: What Trump, Xi and Putin want</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:acb759693ef12dd7c674a15c4493820c5b324978fd566361aa75c600f6a41696</id><updated>2026-11-18T07:43:45Z</updated><published>2026-11-18T05:39:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.dw.com/en/apec-summit-what-trump-xi-and-putin-want/a-79970462--5ebb76396afb.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.dw.com/en/apec-summit-what-trump-xi-and-putin-want/a-79970462?maca=en-rss-en-all-1573-xml-mrss" /><summary type="html">Trump, Xi and Putin will hold their first trilateral meeting on the sidelines of APEC. With different priorities on trade, Ukraine, Iran and arms control, what does each leader hope to gain?</summary><category term="World" /></entry><entry><title>Pakistani man gets 27 years for foiled plot to kill Trump, Biden</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:48efe1943cdc35a4df18daae3f3ec3e45708cef666b96428f305d62fa20a1ff3</id><updated>2026-11-18T07:45:18Z</updated><published>2026-11-18T04:03:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.dw.com/en/pakistani-man-gets-27-years-for-foiled-plot-to-kill-trump-biden/a-79976086--91c6b173dcef.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.dw.com/en/pakistani-man-gets-27-years-for-foiled-plot-to-kill-trump-biden/a-79976086?maca=en-rss-en-all-1573-xml-mrss" /><summary type="html">A Pakistani man with ties to Iran's government was sentenced to more than 27 years in prison for his role in plotting to kill US politicians, including President Donald Trump.</summary><category term="News" /></entry><entry><title>Slovakia: Thousands protest against pro-Kremlin leader Robert Fico</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:d7a54d485cf5038c6d6f675690ab8fdeebb009563a1717e4adccfae049f984c7</id><updated>2026-11-18T07:45:02Z</updated><published>2026-11-18T03:06:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/ww