has sought to deflect criticism by claiming its bad behavior is a thing of the past.</summary><category term="News" /></entry><entry><title>Saudi Arabia: Rights groups raise alarm over rising number of executions</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:6e805f5dbab41a2bd139334d2d48f0770d2433c04d5168c405a0f604c274a75d</id><updated>2026-11-18T07:43:45Z</updated><published>2026-11-17T17:02:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.dw.com/en/saudi-arabia-rights-groups-raise-alarm-over-rising-number-of-executions/a-79970773--88ad6ac6f724.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.dw.com/en/saudi-arabia-rights-groups-raise-alarm-over-rising-number-of-executions/a-79970773?maca=en-rss-en-all-1573-xml-mrss" /><summary type="html">Amid the war in Iran, Saudi Arabia's human rights situation remains bleak, with at least 211 executions, corporal punishment and an intensifying crackdown on critics. Is the regional conflict driving domestic repression?</summary><category term="World" /></entry><entry><title>US and Mexico lose measles-free status</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:d7c3140376e2b95a1f5c60aa2a5f2e218995fe637640cd5a6a7b8a50a4761082</id><updated>2026-11-18T07:43:45Z</updated><published>2026-11-17T16:40:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.dw.com/en/us-and-mexico-lose-measles-free-status/a-79973966--f59bc5b58da7.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.dw.com/en/us-and-mexico-lose-measles-free-status/a-79973966?maca=en-rss-en-all-1573-xml-mrss" /><summary type="html">The United States lost its measles elimination status after 26 years, the Pan American Health Organization has said. Bolivia and Mexico have also lost their measles elimination status.</summary><category term="News" /></entry><entry><title>Back to 1997: Russia wants NATO to roll back its eastern expansion</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:68372b22e8392d6ccd59ae40156a35e26de92544229a72b1ca87d9a251321380</id><updated>2026-11-18T07:43:45Z</updated><published