r-is-ethiopia-sliding-into-a-regional-war/a-79970353?maca=en-rss-en-all-1573-xml-mrss" /><summary type="html">As Ethiopian troops push Tigrayan forces toward the Eritrean border, fears of a new regional war are growing. With tensions rising between Ethiopia, Eritrea and Sudan, the Horn of Africa faces uncertain times ahead.</summary><category term="World" /></entry><entry><title>Nvidia forms national security committee after Huang affair</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:bed6e5c5be595ca55a66449c812d9a5d330505fc29e7b715c00a93a01c3fb985</id><updated>2026-11-18T07:43:45Z</updated><published>2026-11-17T14:53:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.dw.com/en/nvidia-forms-national-security-committee-after-huang-affair/a-79970447--7d1c93df3ff0.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.dw.com/en/nvidia-forms-national-security-committee-after-huang-affair/a-79970447?maca=en-rss-en-all-1573-xml-mrss" /><summary type="html">Nvidia has created a board-level committee for national security and export control. This follows the resignation of CEO Jensen Huang over extramarital affairs, allegedly including one with a Chinese intelligence asset.</summary><category term="News" /></entry><entry><title>Iran dismisses report of alleged 'dirty bomb' attack on Washington</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:3627c69f0c98af161d3af4fe216c0174dc1516c4a7451362a00c1930aa0efe0f</id><updated>2026-11-18T07:43:45Z</updated><published>2026-11-17T14:39:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.dw.com/en/iran-dismisses-report-of-alleged-dirty-bomb-attack-on-washington/a-79970741--39825cf9b7d2.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.dw.com/en/iran-dismisses-report-of-alleged-dirty-bomb-attack-on-washington/a-79970741?maca=en-rss-en-all-1573-xml-mrss" /><summary type="html">Iran has said CNN's claim that Tehran would attack Washington with a "dirty bomb" was an attempt to manufacture further legitimacy to continue the war. Trump has said his administration takes the claim "very seriously."</summary><category term="News" /></entry><entry><title>Guinea jails 200 in wildcat gold mining crackdown</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:cf427964d0cd506dd24e227eb8c88c33f17587c701178b43de905d64faee083b</id><updated>2026-11-18T07:43:45Z</updated><published>2026-11-17T12:30:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.dw.com/en/guinea-jails-200-in-wildcat-gold-mining-crackdown/a-79968808--52f221020a34.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.dw.com/en/guinea-jails-200-in-wildcat-gold-mining-crackdown/a-79968808?maca=en-rss-en-all-1573-xml-mrss" /><summary type="html">A Conakry court has jailed 22 former local officials from the gold-rich northeastern Siguiri region, as well as 200 people accused of illegal mining. It's part of a wider crackdown that sent thousands fleeing into Mali.</summary><category term="News" /></entry><entry><title>US flexes climate action muscle at COP31 despite Trump no-show</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:f51fe1d9dcbed9fcc4f2ddce7a32d3a400e8ecd716de547ac8282e4539eb9d61</id><updated>2026-11-18T07:43:45Z</updated><published>2026-11-17T12:16:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.dw.com/en/us-flexes-climate-action-muscle-at-cop31-despite-trump-no-show/a-79968666--20e2652dd010.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.dw.com/en/us-flexes-climate-action-muscle-at-cop31-despite-trump-no-show/a-79968666?maca=en-rss-en-all-1573-xml-mrss" /><summary type="html">The US government is snubbing UN climate talks in Turkey. That's prompted a delegation of American lawmakers, mayors and governors to make the trip instead, aiming to show climate action in the US is alive and well.</summary><category term="Climate" /></entry><entry><title>Students' List candidates take seats as Serbian parliament opens</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:fdc6f469b5aabe19f3e694e83912a37bfc60c0b708b20083a7da9fc2c7714bbf</id><updated>2026-11-18T07:43:45Z</updated><published>2026-11-17T12:09:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.dw.com/en/students-list-candidates-take-seats-as-serbian-parliament-opens/a-79969166--96de93cfad7f.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.dw.com/en/students-list-candidates-take-seats-as-serbian-parliament-opens/a-79969166?maca=en-rss-en-all-1573-xml-mrss" /><summary type="html">Serbia's Student List's candidates have taken their oaths in the inaugural parliament session. As the new majority, they have 90 days to form a government.</summary><category term="News" /></entry><entry><title>Klopp and Wirtz offer glimpse of bright German future</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:b358b03ee94e66b9ffffb0ef526dccbc70109ffc5af570840ee423e3f04e67fb</id><updated>2026-11-18T07:43:45Z</updated><published>2026-11-17T11:55:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.dw.com/en/klopp-and-wirtz-offer-glimpse-of-bright-german-future/a-79968184--a5059b3200c7.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.dw.com/en/klopp-and-wirtz-offer-glimpse-of-bright-german-future/a-79968184?maca=en-rss-en-all-1573-xml-mrss" /><summary type="html">Germany's fall from grace in recent years has seen the team drift away from the fans. But Monday's drubbing of the Netherlands and the impact of Jürgen Klopp, Florian Wirtz and emerging youngsters offers hope.</summary><category term="Sports" /></entry><entry><title>Could the Airbus' €3 billion loan row reignite a US-EU trade dispute?</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:bf18014d48c649cabd8bdfd1cf4ab511d5438163078047d42026f6015b0fce62</id><updated>2026-11-18T07:43:45Z</updated><published>2026-11-17T11:00:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.dw.com/en/could-the-airbus-_3-billion-loan-row-reignite-a-us-eu-trade-dispute/a-79943075--30f362f3b820.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.dw.com/en/could-the-airbus-€3-billion-loan-row-reignite-a-us-eu-trade-dispute/a-79943075?maca=en-rss-en-all-1573-xml-mrss" /><summary type="html">The US says a record €3 billion financing package for Airbus may conflict with a transatlantic aircraft-subsidy truce. EU officials insist the funding complies with market-based rules.</summary><category term="Business" /></entry><entry><title>Germany news: Plans for Rwanda migrant hub come under fire</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:8f4df4413d99d271b45423510caf13fb970116276caf68fcf459776edc972fd2</id><updated>2026-11-18T07:43:45Z</updated><published>2026-11-17T10:15:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.dw.com/en/germany-news-plans-for-rwanda-migrant-hub-come-under-fire/live-79965639--9c6685ac3d74.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.dw.com/en/germany-news-plans-for-rwanda-migrant-hub-come-under-fire/live-79965639?maca=en-rss-en-all-1573-xml-mrss" /><summary type="html">Human rights groups have slammed plans by Germany and four other EU states to send rejected asylum seekers to Rwanda. In other news, business start-ups in Germany are on track to reach the highest level since 2015.</summary><category term="News" /></entry><entry><title>APEC summit: Trump to travel to China for talks with Putin, Xi</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:fac84e53e7300322be699393783c7af6e781a8f717d69a608555f41b4d8b4f81</id><updated>2026-11-18T07:45:26Z</updated><published>2026-11-17T07:34:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.dw.com/en/apec-summit-trump-to-travel-to-china-for-talks-with-putin-xi/live-79964719--5b469a680c53.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.dw.com/en/apec-summit-trump-to-travel-to-china-for-talks-with-putin-xi/live-79964719?maca=en-rss-en-all-1573-xml-mrss" /><summary type="html">US President Donald Trump is set to travel to the Chinese tech hub of Shenzhen for a much-anticipated meeting with Russian and Chinese counterparts. Follow live.</summary><category term="News" /></entry><entry><title>France's Philippe Diallo to challenge Infantino for FIFA presidency</title><id>